WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.789 --> 00:00:03.159
(upbeat music)
(audience cheers)

00:00:03.159 --> 00:00:03.992
- All right, y'all.

00:00:03.992 --> 00:00:05.339
When I find something on social media

00:00:05.339 --> 00:00:07.578
that's super cute, I
wanna share it with you.

00:00:07.578 --> 00:00:08.930
So this is what I'm liking.

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:10.789
(upbeat music)

00:00:10.789 --> 00:00:12.090
(audience cheers)

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:14.850
So you never know when
your kids might stumble

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:16.530
upon the next great idea.

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:17.580
Like who would've thought

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:18.690
that a four-year-old girl

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:21.159
bringing a chicken into her cheer routine,

00:00:21.159 --> 00:00:22.830
which totally makes sense,

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.630
would take the internet by storm.

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.550
But indeed, it has.

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:27.743
- Five, six, seven, eight.

00:00:28.578 --> 00:00:33.578
One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

00:00:34.111 --> 00:00:36.399
(audience applauds)

00:00:36.399 --> 00:00:39.566
- That Instagram post has 32.5 million

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.000
views and counting.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.399
They are impressed by the chicken dance.

00:00:44.399 --> 00:00:47.070
We have the young cheerleader
on the line right now,

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:49.890
along with her mama watching on KXXV.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:50.850
Hi Fallon.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:51.799
Hi Kendall.

00:00:51.799 --> 00:00:52.950
(audience cheers)

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:54.159
- Hi Kelly.

00:00:54.159 --> 00:00:56.000
Thank you so much for having us.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.230
- Oh my gosh, you are so cute.

00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:00.060
So Kendall, how did this happen?

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.070
- So we got chickens around the same time

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:03.090
she started cheerleading.

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:04.830
She begged for cheer for a long time.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.150
We finally put her in

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:07.290
and then we got chickens too.

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:09.600
So she started spending lots
of time outside with them

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:12.030
and just combined the
two loves that she had.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.560
And I turned around one day

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:14.820
and she was stunting her chicken.

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:17.610
I was like, that's actually
a really solid routine.

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.500
So I recorded it and posted it,

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:20.580
and that's when it just took off.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.570
It was crazy.

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:23.730
- So what would Kelsey say to you,

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:25.410
do you think, Fallon?

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:26.500
- I love you.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.380
(audience coos)

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:30.663
- Oh my God, you are so cute.

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:33.990
Ah, you make me wanna have babies.

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:36.780
Ah, but I don't wanna do that anymore.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:37.890
Okay.

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:39.090
I love you, Fallon.

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:40.380
Your name is so awesome too.

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:41.460
Mama, way to go on the name.

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:43.080
That's such a cool first name.

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:45.453
So you have a new cheer, don't you?

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:47.430
Yeah?

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:49.470
Do you wanna show me your cheer?

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:50.679
- Yeah.
Let's show her.

00:01:50.679 --> 00:01:53.512
(audience cheers)

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:58.650
- [Kelly] Oh, there we
go. (audience laughs)

00:01:58.650 --> 00:01:59.823
Yeah, dad!

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:03.599
- Five, six, seven, eight.

00:02:03.599 --> 00:02:08.599
One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:13.060
(audience applauds)

00:02:13.959 --> 00:02:17.159
- You are incredible, Fallon!

00:02:17.159 --> 00:02:18.233
You're so cool.

00:02:18.233 --> 00:02:20.433
Fallon, thank you for joining us.

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:22.980
Thank you, Fallon.

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:26.040
Thank you Kendall and Kelsey of course.

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.960
I'm liking y'all's post right now.

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:29.070
Look how gentle.

00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:30.870
Oh my God, you're so cute.

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:32.210
Way to go, mama.

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:33.810
(audience coos)

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:35.730
Aw.

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:37.380
Okay, so that's not all.

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:39.930
Our season long partner
Pilot, pen makers of G2,

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:41.400
the go to pen of the
"Kelly Clarkson Show",

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.350
