00:02:47.741 --> 00:02:49.461
(audience cheers)
How's that sound?

00:02:49.461 --> 00:02:51.763
- Oh my goodness.

00:02:51.763 --> 00:02:53.043
Thank you so much.

00:02:53.043 --> 00:02:54.390
- Thank you guys so much.

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:58.050
You have made me have the
greatest day ever, Fallon.

00:02:58.050 --> 00:02:59.210
I love you, sweetheart.

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:00.513
Thank you for joining us

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:02.011
